  "author_association": "NONE",
  "body": "Closes #35.\n\n## Summary\n- switch Cursor adapter from transcript-only provenance to real local token sources in Cursor global storage\n- support both older assistant-bubble `tokenCount` records and newer `promptTokenBreakdown.totalUsedTokens` / `contextTokensUsed` records\n- keep cache/model provenance honest when Cursor local state does not expose those fields\n- add tests and docs for both Cursor local formats\n\n## Verification\n- `uv run python -m unittest tests.test_app tests.test_readme -v`\n- `uv run python -m py_compile app.py scripts/snapshot_dashboard.py`\n- Playwright smoke check on 30d dashboard view\n\n## Screenshot\n![Cursor 30d screenshot](https://github.com/RaihanParl/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/blob/cursor-real-tokens-35/docs/screenshots/cursor-30d-source.png?raw=1)\n",
